text: ['Apocalypse Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it. If X is 5 or more, it enters the battlefield with an additional X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{1}{R}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Apocalypse Hydra: It deals 1 damage to any target.', "As Nyxathid enters the battlefield, choose an opponent.\\nNyxathid gets -1/-1 for each card in the chosen player's hand.", "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws two additional cards.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a black permanent, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodhall Ooze.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a green permanent, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodhall Ooze.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, sacrifice Wild Leotau unless you pay {G}.', "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Cliffrunner Behemoth has haste as long as you control a red permanent.\\nCliffrunner Behemoth has lifelink as long as you control a white permanent.', 'Counter target noncreature spell. Its controller loses 2 life.', "Counter target spell. If that spell is countered this way, put it on top of its owner's library instead of into that player's graveyard.", 'Counter target spell.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Court Homunculus gets +1/+1 as long as you control another artifact.', 'Create X 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. If X is 5 or more, destroy all other creatures.', 'Creatures you control get +1/+2 until end of turn. Untap those creatures.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{W} ({1}{W}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Creatures your opponents control get -1/-0.', 'Dark Temper deals 2 damage to target creature. If you control a black permanent, destroy the creature instead.', 'Defender, flying\\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may gain life equal to the power of target creature you control.', 'Destroy target artifact creature.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. If that permanent was blue or black, draw a card.', 'Destroy target creature if it has the least power or is tied for least power among creatures on the battlefield.', 'Devour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nHellkite Hatchling has flying and trample if it devoured a creature.', 'Domain — Create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Equipped creature gets +1/+1 for each basic land type among lands you control.\\nEquip {3}', 'Domain — Look at the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control. Put one of those cards into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Domain — Matca Rioters's power and toughness are each equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Domain — Search your library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Exploding Borders deals X damage to target player or planeswalker, where X is the number of basic land types among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — Target player discards a card for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Domain — {3}: Wandering Goblins gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each basic land type among lands you control.', 'Double strike\\n{B}{G}: Viashino Slaughtermaster gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', 'Draw cards equal to the power of target creature you control.', 'Enchant Forest or Plains\\nWhenever enchanted land becomes tapped, its controller loses 2 life.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3 and has flying.\\nWhenever enchanted creature deals damage to a player, that player discards two cards.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has flying, first strike, and vigilance.', 'Enchant creature\\nWhen a creature dies, destroy enchanted creature.', "Enchant red or green creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0.\\nEquip {1} ({1}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhen Rhox Bodyguard enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{T}: Add {G}, {W}, or {U}.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{T}: Destroy target creature that dealt damage to you this turn.', 'Exalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\n{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.', 'Exile target black or red permanent.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'First strike\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Dragonsoul Knight becomes a Dragon, gets +5/+3, and gains flying and trample.', 'First strike\\n{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Until end of turn, Paragon of the Amesha becomes an Angel, gets +3/+3, and gains flying and lifelink.', 'Flash\\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)', 'Flying', 'Flying, trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each player loses 1 life. Put a +1/+1 counter on Blood Tyrant for each 1 life lost this way.\\nWhenever a player loses the game, put five +1/+1 counters on Blood Tyrant.', "Flying\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return an artifact you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\n{2}{R}: Pestilent Kathari gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nDevour 1 (As this enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This creature enters the battlefield with that many +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhen Voracious Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals damage to any target equal to twice the number of Goblins it devoured.', "Flying\\nDomain — Aven Trailblazer's toughness is equal to the number of basic land types among lands you control.", 'Flying\\nExalted (Whenever a creature you control attacks alone, that creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Faerie Mechanist enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Flying\\nWhen Magister Sphinx enters the battlefield, target player's life total becomes 10.", 'Flying\\nWhen Malfegor enters the battlefield, discard your hand. Each opponent sacrifices a creature for each card discarded this way.', 'Flying\\nWhen Parasitic Strix enters the battlefield, if you control a black permanent, target player loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx Summoner enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an artifact creature card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Maelstrom Archangel deals combat damage to a player, you may cast a spell from your hand without paying its mana cost.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another creature leaves the battlefield, you may have target player mill two cards.\\nUnearth {2}{B} ({2}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\\nYou may cast Worldheart Phoenix from your graveyard by paying {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} rather than paying its mana cost. If you do, it enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.', "Flying\\n{1}{G}{U}: Creatures you control gain shroud until end of turn. (They can't be the targets of spells or abilities.)", 'Flying\\n{1}{W}{B}, {T}: Destroy target creature or enchantment.\\n{2}{U}: Untap Ethersworn Adjudicator.', 'Flying\\n{B}: Darklit Gargoyle gets +2/-1 until end of turn.', 'Haste\\n{R}, {T}: Create a 3/1 red Elemental creature token with haste.', 'Ignite Disorder deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three target white and/or blue creatures.', 'Knight of the Reliquary gets +1/+1 for each land card in your graveyard.\\n{T}, Sacrifice a Forest or Plains: Search your library for a land card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Prevent all noncombat damage that would be dealt to creatures you control.', 'Protection from artifacts', 'Protection from black', 'Protection from blue', "Protection from everything\\nIf Progenitus would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Progenitus and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", 'Protection from green', 'Protection from red', 'Protection from white', "Quenchable Fire deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. It deals an additional 3 damage to that player or planeswalker at the beginning of your next upkeep step unless that player or that planeswalker's controller pays {U} before that step.", 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nAs long as you control a red permanent, Ember Weaver gets +1/+0 and has first strike.', "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Rupture Spire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rupture Spire enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sacrifice Suicidal Charge: Creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn. Those creatures attack this turn if able.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Scarland Thrinax.', 'Salvage Slasher gets +1/+0 for each artifact card in your graveyard.', 'Search your library for a Plains card, an Island card, a Swamp card, and a Mountain card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Search your library for a white card, a blue card, a black card, a red card, and a green card. Reveal those cards, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', "Shambling Remains can't block.\\nUnearth {B}{R} ({B}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", "Target creature gains flying until end of turn. If you control a white permanent, return View from Above to its owner's hand.", 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Target opponent reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. That player puts all noncreature cards revealed this way into their graveyard, then you put the creature card onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Target player gains 8 life.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{G} ({1}{G}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Target player loses 4 life and you gain 4 life.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{B} ({1}{B}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', "This spell can't be countered.\\nVolcanic Fallout deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.", 'Toxic Iguanar has deathtouch as long as you control a green permanent. (Any amount of damage a creature with deathtouch deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Trample, haste\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Hellspark Elemental.\\nUnearth {1}{R} ({1}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a blue permanent, you may create a token that's a copy of Mirror-Sigil Sergeant.", "Trample\\nIslandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\\nShroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", "Trample\\nWhen Child of Alara dies, destroy all nonland permanents. They can't be regenerated.", 'Trample\\nWhenever Charnelhoard Wurm deals damage to an opponent, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Vigilance, trample\\nWhenever Meglonoth blocks a creature, Meglonoth deals damage to that creature's controller equal to Meglonoth's power.", "Vigilance\\n{R}, {T}: Target creature can't block this turn.\\n{G}, {T}: Target creature blocks this turn if able.", "Vigilance\\n{T}: Reveal the top card of your library. If it's a land card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your hand.", 'When Brackwater Elemental attacks or blocks, sacrifice it at the beginning of the next end step.\\nUnearth {2}{U} ({2}{U}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Grixis Slavedriver leaves the battlefield, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.\\nUnearth {3}{B} ({3}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Kaleidostone enters the battlefield, draw a card.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Kaleidostone: Add {W}{U}{B}{R}{G}.', 'When Rhox Meditant enters the battlefield, if you control a green permanent, draw a card.', 'When Rotting Rats enters the battlefield, each player discards a card.\\nUnearth {1}{B} ({1}{B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', "When Sedraxis Alchemist enters the battlefield, if you control a blue permanent, return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.", 'When Tukatongue Thallid dies, create a 1/1 green Saproling creature token.', 'Whenever Infectious Horror attacks, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever an opponent draws a card, if you control a red permanent, you may have Kederekt Parasite deal 1 damage to that player.', 'Whenever another artifact enters the battlefield under your control or another artifact you control leaves the battlefield, you may pay {1}. If you do, target player loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Whenever another creature with power 5 or greater enters the battlefield under your control, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', "[+3]: Destroy target noncreature permanent.\\n[−2]: Gain control of target creature.\\n[−9]: Nicol Bolas, Planeswalker deals 7 damage to target player or planeswalker. That player or that planeswalker's controller discards seven cards, then sacrifices seven permanents.", '{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{1}, {T}: Add {R}{G}{W}.', '{1}: Regenerate target creature with power 5 or greater.', '{1}: Target creature with power 5 or greater gains vigilance until end of turn.', '{1}{B}, {T}: Target player discards a card. Activate only during your turn.', '{1}{R}, Sacrifice a land: Put a +1/+1 counter on Goblin Razerunners.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may have Goblin Razerunners deal damage equal to the number of +1/+1 counters on it to target player or planeswalker.', '{1}{U}{R}: Dreadwing gets +3/+0 and gains flying until end of turn.', '{1}{W}, {T}: You gain 5 life.\\n{1}{U}, {T}: Draw a card, then discard a card.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Obelisk of Alara deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n{1}{G}, {T}: Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', '{1}{W}: Kranioceros gets +0/+3 until end of turn.', '{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Armillary Sphere: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{G}: Thornling gains haste until end of turn.\\n{G}: Thornling gains trample until end of turn.\\n{G}: Thornling gains indestructible until end of turn.\\n{1}: Thornling gets +1/-1 until end of turn.\\n{1}: Thornling gets -1/+1 until end of turn.', '{R}{G}{W}: Cylian Sunsinger and each other creature with the same name as it get +3/+3 until end of turn.', '{R}{W}, {T}: Sacellum Archers deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "{T}: Prevent the next 1 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.\\n{T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Scattershot Archer deals 1 damage to each creature with flying.', '{T}: Target land you control becomes the basic land type of your choice until end of turn.', "{U}, {T}, Return an artifact you control to its owner's hand: You may put an artifact card from your hand onto the battlefield.", "{U}{B}: Vectis Agents gets -2/-0 until end of turn and can't be blocked this turn.", '{W}, {T}: Tap target permanent.', "{W}{B}: Scornful Aether-Lich gains fear and vigilance until end of turn. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap, and it can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)", "{W}{U}, {T}: Put a bribery counter on target creature you don't control. Its controller draws a card.\\nCreatures with bribery counters on them can't attack or block.", "{W}{U}{B}{R}{G}: Fleshformer gets +2/+2 and gains fear until end of turn. Target creature gets -2/-2 until end of turn. Activate only during your turn. (A creature with fear can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or black creatures.)"]
flavor: ['"A surly beast, the kranioceros will raise its defenses at the smallest threat. Stay out of sight and downwind, or you\'ll disrupt its natural migrations."\\n—Ebrel, godtoucher mentor', '"Bant is a world imprisoned by polished stone and tyrannical rule. It yearns to strike back against those who restrain it."', '"Blades dull and armor dents. Marisi taught us that instinct is the only thing a true warrior needs."\\n—Ajani', '"Each night, the sun unravels and blows away. Each day, the spiders set a new one in the sky."\\n—Sunseeder myth', '"Everyone has a price."', '"Gods do not sleep soundly in the earth\'s embrace."\\n—Mayael the Anima', '"How can we outrun the sky?"\\n—Hadran, sunseeder of Naya', '"I\'ll fight two at once, and then lick their guts from my blades."', '"If I had many lives, I would give them all for Bant."', '"Into its maw went the seventh sea, never to be seen again while the world remains."\\n—Esper fable', '"It was a strange morning. When we awoke, we found our trees transformed. We didn\'t know whether to water them or polish them."\\n—Pulan, Bant orchardist', '"It\'s simple, really. If they can\'t find us, they can\'t kill us."', '"Knowledge of Bant\'s landscape and ruins is a weapon that the invaders can\'t comprehend."\\n—Elspeth', '"Leotau that were born wild make the best mounts. It\'s like riding a thunderstorm."\\n—Rafiq of the Many', '"Let my lance sing with the voices of angels and the heathen cower before my shield, for I will teach this land the meaning of honor."', '"Our arrows are aimed not at the sacred behemoths but at those who dare to dream of such a trophy."', '"Send it back to its own strange world so we can avoid another inglorious combat with these wicked beings."\\n—Captain Valek of Jhess', '"The bird wore the form of a man, bereft of filigree. Why do the Texts not speak of it?"\\n—Belator of Esper', '"The finest pawns are those with pawns of their own."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"The meek inherit nothing."\\n—Sedris, the Traitor King', '"The road to truth has many branches, and so must the cane with which I walk it."\\n—Voln the Elder', '"The smiths of this land must be mad to reach so far and so high for another creature to decorate."\\n—Cagen Vargan, Jhessian sea scout', '"The stone is more potent than ever. The flesh that creeps into our land will become even more slovenly and weak."\\n—Niclavs, archmage of Esper', '"The sun shines bright upon the strong."', '"There is only one way of life in Jund: feed on the weak until you are cut down by something stronger."\\n—Jorshu of Clan Nel Toth', '"These benighted worlds are thick with ignorance. I will educate them. They will listen, or they will die."', '"They think they\'re winning. But they\'re just lining up to be dinner."\\n—Rakka Mar', '"This air feels so heavy and thick. There are no winds to speak of. I fear the knowledge that comes from a place like this."', '"This new chaos confounds us. We must fling it into our winds, our storms. These we can control."\\n—Bezzit Plar, Esper stormcaller', '"To trespass so far from home is to ask for a lonesome grave."', '"Wasted potential surrounds us. Lend me that bauble, and let me see what it can be made to be."', '"We must hunt and kill the dragon before it can return to raze our ancient city."', '"Whether or not you will bow to me is not open to debate. The question is, will I ever let you rise?"\\n—Fridius, telemin master', '"With no flesh, there is no pain, no hesitation, no emotion of any kind. He is crafted perfection."\\n—Tezzeret', '"You have two choices: heed my advice now or need my healing later."', 'A demon cannot be trusted, and a dragon will not be ruled.', 'A drop of blood spilled from the first dragon.', 'A killing machine from birth.', 'A paragon of honor, Galo Aher fell to a blast of fire. The Order of the White Orchid was so saddened that they forged a new sigil in his likeness.', 'After finding no sustenance on the edges of Grixis, it turned to the skies of Bant.', 'After years of honing her philosophy in debate with stubborn rhoxes, Niella was ready to convert any heathen.', "After years of world-bending machinations, Bolas's triumph is at hand.", 'Alara is broken no more.', 'An avatar he sculpts of wisdom and strength.', 'An enlightened soul caged in a body made for battle.', 'As Grixis collided with the rest of Alara, the worlds began to hear the hateful whispers of the forgotten dead.', 'As his new wings lifted him high above Bant, Taric felt his earthly aspirations transform into heavenly resolve.', 'As the outsiders invaded Bant, soldiers who once saw sigils as the highest marks of glory began to see the scars of battle as tokens of equal worth.', 'As the shards merged into the Maelstrom, their mana energies fused into new monstrosities.', 'As the shards merged, relics once thought mundane regained forgotten powers.', 'Born of volcanic forces, it thrives on the absolute panic it inspires.', "Built in honor of Alara's creatures, the ziggurat vanished long ago. When Progenitus awakened, the temple emerged again.", 'Dreadwings spring from lofty perches to surprise kathari in midflight. They smother their prey and then consume it as they glide gently toward the ground.', 'Each of the twenty-three winds of Esper is named and chronicled, and every possible interaction with the flow of magic is exhaustively detailed.', "Egbol stared in wonder at Naya's landscape. So much to eat. So much to steal.", 'Esper artificers never imagined that one day their scraps would be pressed against their soft and fragile throats.', 'Esper mages devised their weapons to be so devastating that war seemed unnecessary.', 'Every horizon hides a new possibility.', 'Finding themselves in a new and unexplored world, they immediately set it on fire.', "For Sarkhan Vol, the dragon is the purest expression of life's savage splendor.", 'In a world where death is always violent, cruel weapons are as common as rocks.', "It shines in the darkness of its master's ambitions.", "It's revered for its power, celebrated for its grace, and feared for the avalanches triggered by its thunderous feet.", 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', "Jund's dragons hoard only sangrite crystals. Its wurms aren't so picky.", "Jund's thallids tried to disguise their deliciousness by covering themselves in spines harvested from the tukatongue tree.", 'Mages of Esper measure their wealth and status by the number of servants in their retinues.', 'Necromancers who discovered the new sources of mana were quick to dream up new nightmares with them.', 'Not once in the history of Grixis has anyone died of old age.', "On Jund, everything eventually ends up in something else's stomach.", 'On Jund, the deep canyons were the best places to hide. When the goblins wandered into Naya, they found that was not so true.', 'Once broken, who knows what worlds might grow from its shards?', 'One goes to Tidehollow either to forget or to be forgotten. Either way, the scullers will oblige.', 'Plowbeasts of Naya escaped their harnesses in droves, content to snack on the conveniently cultivated fields of Eos and Valeron.', 'Priests of Bant protect their temples with traps more elaborate than any mosaic floor.', 'Reuniting a world is not a gentle process.', "Seeds from Jund don't drift gently on the wind. They get up and stampede.", 'She protects the sacred groves from blight, drought, and the Unbeholden.', 'Some who scouted new lands chose to stay.', 'Survival in the wilds of Naya left Tiyan well equipped to win the civilized battles of Bant.', 'Taste his power, hunger for his command.', 'The Seekers of Carmot searched across the unknown lands for the mystical red stone that could reforge Esper in ethereal perfection.', 'The Soul of the World has returned.', 'The barbarians of Jund believe the bottomless tar pits extend forever into other, darker worlds.', "The battle was won in the commander's head before the first weapon was drawn.", "The bones of Jund's dead resurfaced in Naya, poisoning the jungle and killing the sunseeders' crops.", 'The combined strength of all five planes spawned creations none had seen before.', "The demon's yoke is part leash, part noose.", 'The elves of Naya were the last to acknowledge the massive shift of mana in their world.', 'The farther he roamed from Jund and its dragons, the more he felt their essence in himself.', "The goblins went to sleep in Jund and awoke in Grixis. They'd never seen a zombie before. They would never see one again.", 'The lives of elves are long, but their memories are longer. Even after death, they do not desert their homes.', 'The metal filigree in his body glowed red-hot, and his flesh soon followed.', "The more metal it digests, the more its jelly will fetch on the alchemists' market.", 'The mysterious purpose of two of the rings had eluded Esper mages—until now.', 'The problem with a liquid that can dissolve anything is finding something to carry it in.', 'The progeny of the Maelstrom shows no allegiance—and no mercy—to any of the five shards.', 'The ripe smell of life drifted into Grixis. The dead caught the scent and with reckless hunger followed it back into Jund.', 'The sphinx tyrannized Bant until a rhox mage tested the hardiness of her shiny parts.', "The spikes of sangrite made the goblin stronger, but they didn't make him any smarter.", 'The weight of her conviction balances on the harmony of her soul.', 'Their war forgotten, the nations of Bant stood united in the face of a common threat.', 'There are no "weak" creatures on Jund. Even the smallest can strike a deadly blow.', 'There is no world where angels fear to tread.', 'They are cautious with their body language and facial expressions. Any stray movement could betray the positions of the troops they protect and cost many lives.', 'They lament the doom that is coming to Bant without realizing the part their own leaders have played in it.', 'Those who dismiss the cylix as an ordinary wooden bowl are blind to the true measure of its worth.', "Those who drink from Malfegor's cup are tainted with hunger and stained with lies.", 'Tired of waiting for a dragon to eat them, some hardy goblins struck out to become meals for the unknown.', 'To train her elves for war, Mayael would drop a sackful of acorns from the tree canopy. Each archer tried to split as many as possible before the acorns hit the forest floor below.', 'Togk Manytooth struggled helplessly as the kathari circled above him. For a warrior, immobilization is a fate worse than death.', 'Underneath the cities of Esper are cycles of life unseen by those who feed them.', 'When Asha left Bant, she ensured that the world would have protection and order in her absence.', "When its smoky plumes light Naya's sky, every creature from the smallest pip fawn to the largest rannet heeds the warning.", 'When outsiders interrupted the matca championship, things got ugly.', 'When the aven scouts located the tower in Esper, the Knights of the Reliquary set off on a righteous crusade to recover their lost treasures.', 'When the meek charge into battle, courage becomes infectious.', "When the shards merged, Mayael found herself the general of Naya's mightiest army.", 'When the smell of passing thoughts piques its hunger, its maw becomes primed with acid and a taste for brains.', "When you've got the temperament of a dragon, every argument is one you'll win.", 'With their life energy suppressed under their etherium enhancements, thieves from Esper found it surprisingly easy to explore the ruins of Grixis.', 'Without a connection of mind and body, magic is just an idea stuck in the head, a word on the tip of a tongue.', "You'd better know how to pray for rain."]
artist: ['Aleksi Briclot', 'Anthony Francisco', 'Ariel Olivetti', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dave Allsop', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Palumbo', 'Dominick Domingo', 'Donato Giancola', 'Franz Vohwinkel', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jason Chan', 'Jean-Sébastien Rossbach', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'John Avon', 'Justin Sweet', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Mark Hyzer', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Nils Hamm', 'Paolo Parente', 'Paul Bonner', 'Pete Venters', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Sal Villagran', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Trevor Claxton', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
